WEBVTT

01:37.490 --> 01:42.890
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.430 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 30]

01:48.430 --> 01:50.430
These are your mother's clothes.

01:51.000 --> 01:51.590
Yes.

01:52.789 --> 01:55.280
When your mother sang
"Tale of the Pipa,"

01:56.310 --> 01:57.310
she wore these.

01:58.430 --> 01:59.840
And only you

02:00.430 --> 02:01.490
are worthy of them.

02:06.590 --> 02:07.590
When I

02:09.190 --> 02:10.449
married her back then,

02:14.280 --> 02:16.230
I was obsessed with her performance.

02:16.230 --> 02:16.910
But

02:18.190 --> 02:19.320
after I married her,

02:19.840 --> 02:21.570
I never saw her wear them again.

02:29.560 --> 02:31.870
And she never came back.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.190
My mother

02:36.150 --> 02:37.560
can never come back.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.030
Yes, yes.

02:42.590 --> 02:44.190
The dead can't come back to life.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.079
She can never come back.

02:45.079 --> 02:45.680
Yes.

02:46.280 --> 02:48.710
But it's good that
you're back, Qingyuan.

02:54.280 --> 02:58.120
My biggest regret is that

02:59.079 --> 03:01.680
I never held you when you were a baby.

03:01.680 --> 03:03.590
I never heard you call me father.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.840
I owe you so much.

03:06.280 --> 03:08.430
But I remember one thing.

03:09.280 --> 03:11.290
-One time, a kid
-Wait for me!

03:12.030 --> 03:13.400
ran into me

03:15.280 --> 03:16.280
with open arms.

03:16.750 --> 03:17.829
"Uncle!"

03:18.030 --> 03:19.030
"Uncle!"

03:19.360 --> 03:21.520
But I could tell at a glance

03:22.190 --> 03:23.190
that it was you.

03:23.560 --> 03:26.690
You're the child of Chunqing and me.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.360
You looked just like her.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.710
Those eyes

03:29.710 --> 03:31.360
and that little nose.

03:35.030 --> 03:36.310
You called me uncle...

03:39.710 --> 03:40.470
Qingyuan,

03:41.280 --> 03:45.280
let me tell you some great news.

03:46.520 --> 03:48.430
Xie Qingyuan,

03:50.030 --> 03:51.630
receive the imperial edict!

03:54.310 --> 03:57.430
The Emperor has pardoned

03:57.800 --> 03:59.960
the Xie family's crimes.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.430
He pardoned us!

04:05.710 --> 04:07.000
Qingyuan,

04:07.470 --> 04:08.920
do you know

04:09.120 --> 04:11.470
this means that from now on,

04:11.470 --> 04:13.000
in all of Hengtang,

04:13.000 --> 04:16.040
I, Xie Shu, am the only powerful one left?

04:16.720 --> 04:17.630
It's ours now.

04:18.680 --> 04:20.190
I assure you,

04:21.070 --> 04:23.720
this is more glorious than all

04:24.430 --> 04:26.560
the Xie family's ancestors combined.

04:26.560 --> 04:29.430
More than a hundred,
even a thousand times.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.890
Congratulations, Father,

04:32.680 --> 04:34.140
on protecting the dignity

04:34.630 --> 04:36.159
of the Xie family.

04:36.750 --> 04:38.010
Father, do you feel joy

04:38.560 --> 04:39.870
in your heart?

04:40.560 --> 04:41.750
Of course I do.

04:44.070 --> 04:45.240
You're just a child.

04:45.750 --> 04:47.350
You don't understand at all.

04:47.750 --> 04:50.280
Do you know how powerful

04:50.560 --> 04:51.820
Shen Zhibai used to be?

04:52.000 --> 04:53.800
Do you know what kind of person

04:54.000 --> 04:55.360
Eunuch Xia was?

04:55.360 --> 04:56.720
He wielded great power in the court!

04:56.720 --> 04:57.940
Do you know

04:58.000 --> 04:59.159
how arrogant

04:59.159 --> 05:00.940
Hu Xing was?

05:01.160 --> 05:02.480
Those three families

05:02.480 --> 05:04.160
weren't the only ones
riding roughshod over me.

05:04.160 --> 05:05.070
There were also Lord Zhang,

05:05.070 --> 05:06.190
Lord Li, Lord Wang,

05:06.310 --> 05:07.510
thousands of them!

05:07.510 --> 05:08.390
Do you know that

05:08.390 --> 05:09.600
they all fell?

05:10.000 --> 05:11.680
And the only one left

05:12.270 --> 05:14.310
is me, the weakest of them all!

05:15.310 --> 05:16.160
Xie Shu!

05:16.560 --> 05:18.360
Can you believe it?

05:18.360 --> 05:19.830
Your father is

05:19.830 --> 05:21.040
so powerful!

05:21.270 --> 05:23.650
Below one person and above everyone else!

05:23.830 --> 05:25.070
From now on,

05:25.560 --> 05:26.830
Hengtang

05:27.310 --> 05:29.270
can be completely called Xietang.

05:29.560 --> 05:32.630
This court belongs to me.

05:34.950 --> 05:36.159
Oh wait, I forgot.

05:36.400 --> 05:38.800
You've already married that boy, Shen Run.

05:38.800 --> 05:39.560
But it doesn't matter.

05:39.560 --> 05:41.159
I'll always be your father.

05:42.510 --> 05:43.370
It's all yours.

05:43.560 --> 05:46.040
Give Shen Run half of it.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.430
Yes.

05:53.830 --> 05:54.950
You are my father.

05:55.750 --> 05:57.350
When I was young, I longed for

05:57.630 --> 05:58.600
a father's love.

05:59.750 --> 06:01.750
It was so easily obtained by others,

06:02.600 --> 06:03.830
but I didn't have it.

06:04.680 --> 06:06.270
I fear that, in this lifetime,

06:06.270 --> 06:08.800
I'm no longer worthy
of possessing this love.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.710
No, my good daughter.

06:11.000 --> 06:12.190
Because my father

06:13.920 --> 06:15.360
killed my mother!

06:21.360 --> 06:22.890
What are you talking about?

06:23.070 --> 06:24.800
The moment you killed my mother

06:25.870 --> 06:27.430
that night, 9 years ago.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.800
It reminds me

06:29.600 --> 06:31.200
in my dreams every night that

06:32.040 --> 06:33.159
you're not my father,

06:33.159 --> 06:34.120
but my enemy!

06:36.720 --> 06:37.920
Every time you tell me

06:38.830 --> 06:40.480
how much you loved my mother,

06:40.920 --> 06:42.270
I feel disgusted.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.120
I'm waiting,

06:45.510 --> 06:46.830
waiting for the day

06:47.190 --> 06:48.650
I take everything from you

06:48.720 --> 06:50.070
and destroy you.

06:50.870 --> 06:52.600
You've killed too many people.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.600
Your hands are covered in blood.

06:55.750 --> 06:56.510
Do you still remember

06:56.510 --> 06:58.510
who the first person you killed was?

07:00.680 --> 07:01.390
Uncle.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.240
Money.

07:06.630 --> 07:08.240
I can give you the money.

07:08.870 --> 07:09.510
But

07:09.800 --> 07:10.750
can you

07:11.120 --> 07:13.040
stop bullying Chunqing?

07:13.430 --> 07:15.430
She is your daughter after all.

07:15.430 --> 07:17.290
Cut the crap. Cough out the money.

07:17.430 --> 07:18.830
Are you even human?

07:22.310 --> 07:23.270
Please,

07:24.160 --> 07:26.040
stop harassing Chunqing.

07:26.160 --> 07:27.950
Stop harassing Chunqing.

07:28.240 --> 07:29.170
What did you say?

07:29.310 --> 07:30.360
I harass her?

07:30.510 --> 07:31.750
I can even marry her!

07:33.560 --> 07:34.310
What?

07:34.680 --> 07:35.720
Let me tell you,

07:38.480 --> 07:40.750
she's not my biological daughter.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.000
You...

07:44.800 --> 07:47.390
You're worse than a beast!

07:50.390 --> 07:52.950
I can tell you a little secret too.

07:53.510 --> 07:54.270
You

07:54.560 --> 07:56.040
are my biological son.

07:58.830 --> 07:59.950
Don't believe me?

08:01.000 --> 08:03.040
Go back and ask Old Madam yourself.

08:04.390 --> 08:06.870
My good son.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.780
I will come look for you again.

08:09.240 --> 08:11.240
If you don't want Chunqing to know,

08:11.630 --> 08:12.630
get me more money!

08:15.000 --> 08:16.190
Remember,

08:16.750 --> 08:17.830
in this life,

08:18.720 --> 08:20.180
you can never get rid of me!

08:25.310 --> 08:26.680
I have money!

08:49.840 --> 08:50.510
Son!

08:52.360 --> 08:53.960
Did you get the money?

08:56.270 --> 08:57.040
Money.

09:03.750 --> 09:04.750
That's right.

09:04.870 --> 09:05.970
That's my

09:06.240 --> 09:07.390
good son.

09:08.680 --> 09:09.560
Tell me,

09:10.100 --> 09:11.620
what was I doing before?

09:13.000 --> 09:13.550
I

09:13.910 --> 09:16.550
should have told you long ago.

09:17.440 --> 09:19.190
I want to trade it for Chunqing.

09:19.320 --> 09:20.390
Can I?

09:24.630 --> 09:25.360
No way.

09:25.620 --> 09:27.020
I'd be taking a huge loss!

09:28.360 --> 09:29.650
Such a huge loss!

09:29.870 --> 09:32.070
Impossible! Don't even think about it!

09:34.150 --> 09:34.840
You...

09:35.510 --> 09:36.630
Unfilial son!

09:44.320 --> 09:47.320
How dare you kill your own father...

09:57.120 --> 09:58.750
Chunqing was burdened by him

09:58.780 --> 10:00.630
and never had a single good day.

10:00.630 --> 10:02.270
I did it to save Chunqing.

10:02.270 --> 10:03.960
You must never tell anyone.

10:03.980 --> 10:06.100
Never tell anyone.

10:06.150 --> 10:07.360
I beg you.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.200
Shen.

10:08.200 --> 10:08.840
Jingzhi?

10:10.000 --> 10:11.030
Shen.

10:12.510 --> 10:14.000
What's going on?

10:20.790 --> 10:21.550
Chunqing.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.110
There are many things

10:23.240 --> 10:24.550
I’ll fill you in on at a later time.

10:24.550 --> 10:26.240
Now I only want to ask you one thing.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.120
If I ask for my mother's permission,

10:28.120 --> 10:29.320
will you marry me?

10:32.870 --> 10:34.080
I...

10:39.790 --> 10:40.750
Will you?

10:45.320 --> 10:46.270
Of course I will.

10:50.840 --> 10:51.840
I don't care about

10:52.480 --> 10:53.390
Jin Chunqing.

10:54.270 --> 10:56.800
I also don't care
if you're the biological son

10:57.030 --> 10:57.790
of the Xie family

10:57.790 --> 10:58.870
or not.

10:59.390 --> 11:00.120
But,

11:01.150 --> 11:02.510
this Shen Zhibai

11:03.270 --> 11:07.000
holds the key to Hengtang’s future
and the imperial court’s politics.

11:07.000 --> 11:11.290
[Respectfully submitted in grief
by Jin Chunqing]

11:07.320 --> 11:11.030
She has dug her own grave
with this letter.

11:11.750 --> 11:13.120
My dear brother-in-law.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.120
Will you

11:14.510 --> 11:15.720
kill her

11:16.670 --> 11:19.130
and continue to enjoy
your wealth and glory,

11:19.150 --> 11:21.440
or will you give up everything
you have now

11:21.440 --> 11:25.040
and go back to your birth parents
to sell charcoal and forge iron?

11:25.550 --> 11:28.320
The choice is yours.

11:26.700 --> 11:28.310
[Respectfully submitted in grief
by Jin Chunqing]

11:29.080 --> 11:29.840
But

11:30.200 --> 11:31.480
once you choose a path,

11:32.240 --> 11:34.790
you must walk it to the end.

12:00.960 --> 12:01.960
Mother is sick.

12:04.120 --> 12:05.520
She asked me to visit you.

12:09.790 --> 12:10.870
It's been 9 years.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.440
You should hate me.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.600
How could I hate you?

12:20.440 --> 12:22.360
I was all alone since childhood.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.270
My father

12:26.030 --> 12:27.750
was that kind of person.

12:28.480 --> 12:31.240
I thought I could never escape that fate.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.630
But you barged into my life.

12:37.320 --> 12:39.150
You ended my suffering.

12:43.480 --> 12:45.390
No matter your reason,

12:46.510 --> 12:48.120
you saved me after all.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.360
Against all pressure,

12:50.360 --> 12:52.490
you married me into the Xie Residence.

12:53.910 --> 12:56.040
Even though they eventually forced me

12:56.960 --> 12:58.490
to leave the Xie Residence,

13:00.840 --> 13:01.910
I know

13:05.360 --> 13:07.150
you did it to protect me.

13:09.000 --> 13:10.390
They hurt you.

13:12.150 --> 13:13.960
They all deserve to die!

13:14.550 --> 13:16.230
I don't blame anyone.

13:17.150 --> 13:19.010
You shouldn't blame them either.

13:21.200 --> 13:23.030
They beat me so hard.

13:25.670 --> 13:26.730
But surprisingly,

13:28.670 --> 13:31.130
they didn't kill the little girl
in my belly.

13:33.630 --> 13:35.200
It's God's will.

13:37.600 --> 13:38.510
Jingzhi.

13:40.480 --> 13:42.080
We have a child.

13:42.910 --> 13:43.870
I saw her.

13:45.480 --> 13:47.120
She's lovely.

13:48.630 --> 13:49.960
She looks just like you.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.320
Chunqing.

13:59.360 --> 14:00.270
It's fine.

14:21.240 --> 14:22.150
I'll do it.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.970
You go back and rest first.

14:58.030 --> 14:58.910
Jingzhi.

14:59.910 --> 15:01.640
Actually, for the past 9 years,

15:03.120 --> 15:04.450
I've been very content.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.440
I lived very happily.

15:07.120 --> 15:09.270
Whenever I look into our child's eyes,

15:10.480 --> 15:12.600
I feel like I can see your reflection.

15:13.600 --> 15:14.860
Whenever I look at her,

15:15.720 --> 15:17.360
it feels as though

15:19.240 --> 15:21.570
we’re still happily together,
as if we had

15:21.910 --> 15:23.510
never been separated.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.190
It's too hot.

15:39.030 --> 15:40.560
Wait a bit before drinking.

15:44.200 --> 15:45.150
Wait a little.

15:45.870 --> 15:46.840
Actually,

15:49.200 --> 15:51.330
after I finished writing that letter,

15:52.240 --> 15:53.600
I figured it out.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.320
Between us,

15:56.360 --> 15:58.690
it seems like you are
living a better life.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.790
But in reality,

16:02.480 --> 16:04.150
you are the pitiful one.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.000
When I found out

16:12.670 --> 16:14.840
I was a daughter of the Xie family,

16:16.000 --> 16:17.240
for a moment,

16:18.120 --> 16:19.840
I also saw that cage.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.750
But when I walked out

16:25.480 --> 16:27.120
and looked back,

16:28.790 --> 16:30.510
I realized it was

16:32.550 --> 16:34.600
completely empty.

16:38.760 --> 16:40.680
There was nothing there.

17:05.680 --> 17:06.640
Jingzhi.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.880
I'm leaving.

17:11.270 --> 17:12.790
I plan to take Yunya

17:13.310 --> 17:14.440
and leave Hengtang.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.040
We'll settle down in a place

17:18.480 --> 17:20.750
with warm springs and blooming flowers.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.349
I will often miss

17:28.960 --> 17:30.760
how you looked when we first met.

17:34.510 --> 17:35.440
Back then,

17:36.680 --> 17:38.480
you were still with Shen Zhibai.

17:40.480 --> 17:43.110
You had endless things to talk about

17:43.440 --> 17:44.680
and do every day.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.540
I didn't understand any of it,

17:49.480 --> 17:51.140
but I loved listening to them.

17:51.830 --> 17:54.000
The Hengtang you described

17:56.310 --> 17:57.640
was truly wonderful.

18:00.720 --> 18:02.350
I wish I could live there

18:05.240 --> 18:06.680
for just one day.

18:11.640 --> 18:21.000
♪ In a rush to seek me,
she neglects her grooming ♪

19:23.400 --> 19:24.400
Chunqing...

19:27.480 --> 19:29.210
There's no turning back for me.

19:31.000 --> 19:31.930
In the next life,

19:33.400 --> 19:35.200
let's be husband and wife again.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.810
What's going on?

20:23.680 --> 20:24.340
Hurry, run!

20:26.200 --> 20:26.890
What was that sound?

20:26.890 --> 20:27.350
After them!

20:27.350 --> 20:28.000
Up there!

20:35.920 --> 20:36.680
Move!

20:38.070 --> 20:38.680
Let's go.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.440
Who told you these?

21:03.460 --> 21:06.160
Who is spreading these rumors?

21:08.590 --> 21:09.440
You've got it wrong!

21:09.440 --> 21:10.970
You actually believe them?

21:12.770 --> 21:14.360
You killed my mother.

21:14.550 --> 21:16.180
You killed your biological father

21:16.180 --> 21:17.380
and adoptive mother.

21:18.270 --> 21:19.990
Your close friend Shen Zhibai

21:20.120 --> 21:21.830
kept your secret for a lifetime,

21:21.830 --> 21:23.350
but you had his entire family executed.

21:23.350 --> 21:25.030
You used their blood

21:25.030 --> 21:26.760
to pave the way for your career.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.200
Well?

21:28.880 --> 21:29.790
Are you

21:30.720 --> 21:31.750
happy now?

21:38.480 --> 21:39.270
Get out!

21:40.840 --> 21:41.840
Who told you this?

21:41.920 --> 21:43.200
Who told you?

21:43.220 --> 21:45.260
Bastard. I'll kill him!

21:47.200 --> 21:48.000
Qingyuan, no.

21:55.160 --> 21:55.880
Bastard!

21:55.880 --> 21:56.610
Give it to me!

21:59.310 --> 22:00.480
You want it?

22:02.830 --> 22:03.590
Here.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.200
This kind of trash,

22:09.790 --> 22:12.140
I can easily forge a thousand copies,

22:12.510 --> 22:13.720
even ten thousand copies.

22:13.720 --> 22:14.590
Are you scared?

22:14.720 --> 22:15.510
Get out!

22:17.440 --> 22:18.750
You are scared.

22:20.270 --> 22:23.030
This letter was kept by Hu Wenzhuo
for 9 years,

22:23.640 --> 22:25.970
but you never dared
to look back at it once.

22:26.070 --> 22:27.670
Because you wanted to forget

22:27.960 --> 22:29.760
why you wanted to kill my mother.

22:29.880 --> 22:32.000
You wanted to forget
those filthy thoughts.

22:32.000 --> 22:32.880
But today,

22:33.240 --> 22:34.750
I will make you remember.

22:36.720 --> 22:38.270
I want you to remember

22:39.960 --> 22:41.960
everything my mother said forever.

22:48.680 --> 22:50.200
When I first met Xie Shu,

22:52.400 --> 22:54.070
he still had light in his eyes.

22:56.160 --> 22:57.160
That light

22:57.640 --> 23:00.110
once gave me hope in the abyss.

23:01.590 --> 23:03.550
Come on, Shen, Jingzhi.

23:03.830 --> 23:04.310
Let's go

23:04.310 --> 23:04.960
and see

23:04.960 --> 23:06.160
what's for dinner.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.110
We'll listen to you.

23:07.110 --> 23:07.680
Okay.

23:07.830 --> 23:10.860
The new Hengtang he painted
together with Shen Zhibai

23:11.070 --> 23:12.880
was something I yearned for.

23:13.240 --> 23:17.640
Those days were
the happiest time of my life.

23:18.270 --> 23:19.830
But the Xie family's secret

23:20.240 --> 23:23.310
will eventually swallow that light
inch by inch

23:23.920 --> 23:25.790
and turn him into another person.

23:27.070 --> 23:28.270
Rather than saying

23:28.790 --> 23:31.630
[Mr. Xie Jingzhi]

23:28.920 --> 23:30.550
I want to save Shen Zhibai,

23:31.200 --> 23:34.330
it's more accurate to say that
the person I want to rescue

23:35.110 --> 23:38.640
is that pitiful person
pushed into the abyss by fate,

23:39.550 --> 23:41.750
my once deeply loved husband,

23:42.550 --> 23:43.880
Xie Shu.

23:46.160 --> 23:47.270
Jingzhi.

23:48.070 --> 23:49.880
There is still time.

23:53.510 --> 23:55.310
Save Shen Zhibai,

23:58.660 --> 24:00.010
and help me

24:03.960 --> 24:06.000
save yourself.

24:13.310 --> 24:14.070
Good.

24:16.070 --> 24:17.400
Very good.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.240
Qingyuan,

24:21.680 --> 24:24.160
I swear that every word I've said

24:25.790 --> 24:27.960
to you today is the truth.

24:28.680 --> 24:30.590
No matter what,

24:30.880 --> 24:32.030
I am,

24:32.430 --> 24:33.550
you could say,

24:35.070 --> 24:36.800
the one who killed your mother,

24:37.400 --> 24:39.030
the woman I loved the most.

24:47.550 --> 24:49.070
Your father, in this life,

24:50.030 --> 24:52.200
has seen countless women.

24:52.790 --> 24:54.000
But I

24:54.000 --> 24:56.310
have only ever loved this one woman,

24:56.510 --> 24:58.030
your mother,

24:58.030 --> 25:00.200
Chunqing.

25:00.440 --> 25:03.200
But I actually killed her.

25:04.070 --> 25:05.400
Isn't it absurd?

25:06.240 --> 25:07.030
Who else?

25:07.030 --> 25:08.240
Shen Zhibai,

25:08.480 --> 25:10.440
my family, my friends...

25:10.440 --> 25:11.640
Everyone around me.

25:11.640 --> 25:13.750
I've killed too many.

25:13.750 --> 25:15.400
Too many of them.

25:15.400 --> 25:17.070
I tried to pen it all down.

25:17.070 --> 25:19.070
I wrote them down and recalled them,

25:19.750 --> 25:21.410
but I simply couldn't keep up.

25:22.110 --> 25:23.550
After some time,

25:23.680 --> 25:26.010
I plan to revise the Xie family genealogy.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.590
Didn't the Xie family say

25:28.590 --> 25:31.960
that Jin Chunqing couldn't enter
the genealogy?

25:32.310 --> 25:34.310
Too bad! I'm including her.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.350
Let me tell you,

25:36.350 --> 25:37.640
I'm going to include her right now,

25:37.640 --> 25:39.040
and I'll write it myself.

25:39.640 --> 25:42.350
Child, do you know how I'll write it?

25:43.310 --> 25:45.970
Hasn't their Xie clan
been around for a century?

25:46.160 --> 25:48.620
Starting from their very first ancestor...

25:49.110 --> 25:50.890
His ancestor's mother,

25:50.920 --> 25:52.510
foster mother, and biological mother

25:52.510 --> 25:54.750
will all be called Jin Chunqing.

25:59.310 --> 26:01.710
After that, every generation of

26:01.920 --> 26:04.510
their head madam will all be
called Jin Chunqing!

26:04.510 --> 26:06.550
I want everyone in the world to know

26:06.550 --> 26:08.000
that your mother's name

26:08.310 --> 26:10.370
is Jin Chunqing!

26:10.590 --> 26:12.440
To avenge your mother,

26:12.550 --> 26:14.440
I'll make sure every generation

26:14.920 --> 26:16.450
of the Xie family was raised

26:16.750 --> 26:20.000
by Jin Chunqing!

26:25.000 --> 26:27.400
Those bastards of the Xie family!

26:29.510 --> 26:32.720
They took my Chunqing away...

26:33.720 --> 26:35.370
Those bastards!

26:36.720 --> 26:39.720
I'll make sure they were all raised
by your mother...

26:47.350 --> 26:49.400
Isn't it satisfying?

26:49.400 --> 26:51.480
I'll avenge your mother...

26:58.790 --> 26:59.750
Chunqing...

27:09.590 --> 27:11.120
There is no chance anymore.

27:23.270 --> 27:26.750
I don't need anyone to give me a chance.

27:28.350 --> 27:29.270
Look at this.

27:29.590 --> 27:30.720
The imperial edict.

27:30.720 --> 27:33.480
His Majesty has pardoned all my crimes.

27:34.000 --> 27:34.680
Is that so?

27:35.960 --> 27:37.360
His Majesty pardoned you

27:37.720 --> 27:40.300
because of the Xie family's achievements,

27:40.640 --> 27:43.770
and the Xie family's prestige in the
Northern Frontier.

27:44.030 --> 27:44.830
Xie Shu.

27:45.200 --> 27:46.960
But this doesn't mean

27:47.750 --> 27:50.680
you are still a member
of the Xie family in the future.

27:51.720 --> 27:53.920
Xie Qingyuan is not only your daughter,

27:55.110 --> 27:56.720
but now also His Majesty's designated

27:56.720 --> 27:58.520
new matriarch of the Xie family.

28:00.920 --> 28:02.980
Are you forcing me to make a decision?

28:03.310 --> 28:04.240
I wouldn't dare.

28:04.430 --> 28:05.560
But Xie Shu

28:05.880 --> 28:07.140
poisoned his beloved,

28:07.310 --> 28:08.570
killed his own father,

28:08.590 --> 28:10.160
drove his adoptive mother to her death,

28:10.160 --> 28:11.240
harmed the loyal and good,

28:11.240 --> 28:12.550
and preyed on the people.

28:12.550 --> 28:13.880
With such evil deeds to his name,

28:13.880 --> 28:15.680
if he still receives your grace,

28:15.680 --> 28:16.790
I fear the world

28:17.000 --> 28:19.350
will doubt Your Majesty's
sense of justice.

28:19.350 --> 28:22.160
If Xie Shu is removed,
Hengtang will fall into chaos.

28:22.160 --> 28:24.240
You are a man who has already died once.

28:24.240 --> 28:27.240
How many lives do you have left
to clean up this mess for me?

28:27.240 --> 28:29.170
It's true that I only have one life,

28:29.680 --> 28:30.790
but Shen Zhibai

28:31.310 --> 28:32.970
and Zhou Pei'an were the same.

28:33.440 --> 28:34.720
But if I dare not

28:35.000 --> 28:37.640
break the deadlock and implement
the new policies today,

28:37.640 --> 28:38.440
in the future,

28:39.000 --> 28:41.130
how many more loyal subjects must die,

28:41.440 --> 28:43.440
and how many more 9 years must we wait

28:44.000 --> 28:45.480
before Your Majesty

28:45.680 --> 28:46.920
makes a decision?

28:50.440 --> 28:53.480
If Your Majesty is worried that
no one will take over Hengtang,

28:53.480 --> 28:55.350
I would like to recommend someone.

28:55.350 --> 28:56.310
Chen Qingyuan

28:56.830 --> 28:59.030
is the only bloodline of the Xie family.

28:59.030 --> 29:00.640
And the Xie family under Qingyuan's reign

29:00.640 --> 29:02.500
will surely innovate and change.

29:03.200 --> 29:05.600
Please make a wise decision, Your Majesty.

29:07.480 --> 29:08.160
Good.

29:10.350 --> 29:12.080
What an innovation and change.

29:12.400 --> 29:13.400
Pass on my decree.

29:13.750 --> 29:15.240
Commander of the Palace Guard,

29:15.240 --> 29:15.960
Shen Run,

29:16.200 --> 29:18.160
shall lead and investigate Xie Shu's case.

29:18.160 --> 29:19.480
I also appoint Chen Qingyuan

29:19.480 --> 29:21.110
as the matriarch of the Xie family.

29:21.110 --> 29:21.880
Her?

29:22.790 --> 29:23.960
A mere girl,

29:24.160 --> 29:26.090
as the matriarch of the Xie family?

29:28.550 --> 29:29.550
Is that possible?

29:30.270 --> 29:32.530
If a woman could be
the head of the family,

29:33.160 --> 29:34.720
would Lu Lingshu have had

29:35.070 --> 29:37.990
the heart to exchange
his own daughter, Chunqing,

29:38.160 --> 29:39.890
for a poor boy like me back then?

29:44.160 --> 29:45.030
Brat.

29:46.070 --> 29:47.200
Ask Qingyuan

29:47.200 --> 29:48.640
what I just said.

29:49.400 --> 29:51.710
No matter how much she annoys me,

29:52.270 --> 29:53.400
I will always

29:54.200 --> 29:56.440
and forever be her father.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.790
Everything I have

29:57.960 --> 29:59.880
also belongs to her.

30:00.240 --> 30:00.720
And what she owns

30:00.720 --> 30:03.440
is also yours in the future.

30:03.750 --> 30:06.400
What did you come to this world for,

30:06.400 --> 30:07.160
brat?

30:07.350 --> 30:08.750
Fame and wealth!

30:09.590 --> 30:12.510
I can make them yours in an instant!

30:12.920 --> 30:14.300
We are a family,

30:14.550 --> 30:15.950
what are we fighting for?

30:17.550 --> 30:19.200
I don't care about the things

30:19.440 --> 30:20.500
the Xie family has.

30:20.960 --> 30:24.290
I have already distributed them
to those who need them more.

30:25.750 --> 30:28.310
Qingyuan has already given
everything the Xie family owns

30:28.310 --> 30:30.440
to the refugees and the people

30:31.480 --> 30:34.160
to promote the new policies in Hengtang.

30:35.750 --> 30:37.480
You're lying to me.

30:38.070 --> 30:39.480
What new policies?

30:40.110 --> 30:41.640
Distributing my property?

30:41.920 --> 30:42.750
Impossible.

30:43.480 --> 30:45.880
Who would give away their own
mountains of gold and silver

30:45.880 --> 30:47.240
to others?

30:48.480 --> 30:49.680
How absurd.

30:49.790 --> 30:50.480
Xie Shu.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.200
Do you still remember

30:53.240 --> 30:54.310
this silver coin?

31:00.960 --> 31:01.720
Shen,

31:02.240 --> 31:04.700
the corrupt official
we impeached together

31:04.880 --> 31:06.540
has finally been eradicated.

31:06.830 --> 31:09.270
I specially minted this silver coin.

31:09.550 --> 31:10.640
This is the beginning of our efforts

31:10.640 --> 31:12.960
to build a better life for the people.

31:16.350 --> 31:17.400
Brother,

31:17.790 --> 31:19.310
as long as the two of us

31:19.310 --> 31:21.440
stand united and work wholeheartedly

31:21.550 --> 31:23.350
for the court and for the people,

31:23.480 --> 31:26.200
we'll surely make those corrupt officials
in Hengtang

31:26.200 --> 31:28.480
spit out every tale of silver they took!

31:28.830 --> 31:30.240
Yes, also.

31:31.160 --> 31:32.000
Brother,

31:32.150 --> 31:33.880
as for the policies
you wrote about in your articles:

31:33.880 --> 31:36.160
measuring the land,

31:36.400 --> 31:37.440
equalizing taxes,

31:37.440 --> 31:38.440
and collecting based on acreage.

31:38.440 --> 31:39.550
These are great policies.

31:39.550 --> 31:40.880
No matter how difficult,

31:40.880 --> 31:42.640
we must implement them.

31:42.880 --> 31:43.590
Brother,

31:44.750 --> 31:46.920
as long as we are united,

31:47.240 --> 31:48.350
these wishes

31:48.680 --> 31:50.880
can all be realized!

31:51.110 --> 31:51.840
Definitely!

31:51.880 --> 31:54.680
The new equalization policy...

31:58.640 --> 32:00.720
We were young and ignorant.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.440
Laughable.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.270
How laughable...

32:05.000 --> 32:06.000
Is it laughable?

32:08.880 --> 32:10.310
What you call laughable

32:10.920 --> 32:12.790
is now on the verge of becoming reality.

32:12.790 --> 32:14.390
The new equalization policy

32:14.790 --> 32:16.230
will be piloted in Hengtang

32:16.230 --> 32:17.510
starting today.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.780
If successful,

32:19.030 --> 32:21.030
it will be implemented nationwide.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.680
Xie Shu.

32:42.030 --> 32:44.290
We are going to burn down your Xie family.

32:47.070 --> 32:48.000
What do you want?

32:48.920 --> 32:50.790
I endured humiliation all my life

32:50.790 --> 32:52.850
and just acquired the family estate.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.480
I haven't even enjoyed it for a day,

32:54.480 --> 32:56.240
and you are going to burn it down?

32:56.240 --> 32:57.720
Are you that greedy?

32:59.590 --> 33:00.590
Wait- wait!

33:00.880 --> 33:02.590
It was all yours to begin with.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.030
My daughter,

33:08.480 --> 33:10.070
can't you even leave me

33:10.070 --> 33:12.730
a bite to eat?

33:13.070 --> 33:15.400
Before you killed those innocent people,

33:16.230 --> 33:18.830
did you ever think of
leaving them a bite to eat?

33:21.830 --> 33:23.360
Have you quelled the flames

33:24.680 --> 33:26.210
of those vengeful spirits?

33:29.200 --> 33:30.070
For my mother,

33:30.480 --> 33:31.310
Jin Chunqing.

33:31.590 --> 33:32.470
For my father,

33:32.640 --> 33:33.480
Shen Zhibai.

33:33.960 --> 33:35.290
And for those countless

33:36.070 --> 33:37.530
wronged souls you killed,

33:39.350 --> 33:40.880
We will return it all to you.

34:19.000 --> 34:20.400
I originally planned

34:20.800 --> 34:22.190
to teach you

34:24.190 --> 34:26.440
one last lesson before I die.

34:28.320 --> 34:29.800
I wanted to teach you

34:30.920 --> 34:33.280
to pay the price

34:33.670 --> 34:35.630
for your sins.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.320
But now...

34:40.230 --> 34:42.510
I can't save you anymore.

35:17.150 --> 35:20.080
Back then, I had a dream
during the Lantern Festival.

35:21.280 --> 35:24.010
All flowers faded during the full moon.

35:24.190 --> 35:26.800
The full moon refers to Qingyuan.

35:27.070 --> 35:28.360
I should have known.

35:31.230 --> 35:32.960
The century-old Xie family

35:33.510 --> 35:36.030
was destined to be destroyed

35:38.000 --> 35:39.840
as soon as Qingyuan appeared.

35:43.920 --> 35:45.650
So, there really is such a thing

35:46.190 --> 35:47.920
as divine will in this world!

35:50.800 --> 35:53.030
My lifelong obsession

35:53.670 --> 35:54.880
amounts to nothing

35:55.510 --> 35:56.280
in the end...

35:57.030 --> 35:58.280
Nothing.

35:59.150 --> 36:01.360
Yet it cost so many lives.

36:03.030 --> 36:06.150
The blood on my hands
can never be washed clean.

36:06.480 --> 36:07.320
So be it.

36:07.020 --> 36:08.110
[Fuyu Pavilion]

36:09.280 --> 36:11.480
Let the fire destroy it.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.710
Let it destroy everything!

36:14.590 --> 36:15.560
Chunqing!

36:16.000 --> 36:17.040
Mother!

36:18.120 --> 36:20.310
I am here to atone!

36:37.320 --> 36:38.180
I didn't expect

36:38.570 --> 36:40.370
that he would choose to die here.

36:41.510 --> 36:43.710
Perhaps it’s only when a person is dying

36:43.920 --> 36:46.780
that they truly come to understand
certain things.

36:46.840 --> 36:48.440
He probably wanted to atone.

37:19.400 --> 37:24.970
[Spring comes to Changmen]

37:25.130 --> 37:30.980
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

37:31.120 --> 37:38.360
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

37:37.170 --> 37:41.240
[Zhongwu Hall]

37:38.380 --> 37:41.740
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

37:41.770 --> 37:45.470
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

37:45.490 --> 37:52.340
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

37:52.410 --> 37:59.770
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

37:53.630 --> 37:55.280
When I left Hengtang,

37:55.440 --> 37:57.240
I made a promise to Fourth Sister

37:57.550 --> 37:59.550
that I would open Yunji Snacks branches

37:59.550 --> 38:00.840
all over the world.

37:59.790 --> 38:06.620
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

38:01.960 --> 38:03.070
And now,

38:03.440 --> 38:05.500
there is even a branch in the capital.

38:05.590 --> 38:08.030
I consider that I have kept my promise.

38:06.650 --> 38:10.670
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

38:07.980 --> 38:13.280
[Zhongwu Hall]

38:08.920 --> 38:10.520
The old Marquis passed away,

38:10.730 --> 38:14.160
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

38:11.110 --> 38:13.510
and Old Madam
went to a manor to recuperate.

38:13.760 --> 38:15.360
The Marquis is busy in the army,

38:14.220 --> 38:21.570
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

38:15.960 --> 38:18.320
leaving early
and returning late every day.

38:18.320 --> 38:19.800
Madam, you're left alone

38:20.710 --> 38:22.110
in the residence.

38:21.600 --> 38:28.240
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

38:28.260 --> 38:35.510
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

38:33.190 --> 38:34.550
Teacher, this hairpin of yours

38:34.550 --> 38:35.670
is elegant and unique.

38:35.530 --> 38:39.240
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

38:36.070 --> 38:38.320
It complements
the flower shadows in the poem

38:38.320 --> 38:39.480
and adds a touch of tranquility.

38:39.270 --> 38:42.900
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

38:41.920 --> 38:43.590
Even if you praise me more,

38:43.020 --> 38:48.920
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

38:44.480 --> 38:46.340
you still have to pay for the book.

38:49.190 --> 38:50.110
It's strange.

38:50.510 --> 38:51.480
Every shop

38:51.480 --> 38:52.740
looks almost the same.

38:52.880 --> 38:53.840
But once you enter,

38:53.840 --> 38:55.570
they are all different inside.

38:55.960 --> 38:57.400
The climate and geography are different,

38:57.400 --> 38:58.840
dietary habits are different,

38:58.840 --> 39:01.280
and individual constitutions
differ even more.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.400
Naturally, every shop

39:02.400 --> 39:04.800
has to adjust its prescriptions
according to the location.

39:04.800 --> 39:05.480
Only then

39:05.710 --> 39:08.710
can it be considered
prescribing the right medicine.

39:08.880 --> 39:11.880
Adjusting prescriptions
according to the location?

39:12.230 --> 39:13.590
Go put out the light.

39:14.320 --> 39:15.000
Madam.

39:15.230 --> 39:17.320
Why are you resting so early?

39:17.590 --> 39:18.510
In the past,

39:18.760 --> 39:20.960
didn't you always leave a light on
for the Marquis

39:20.960 --> 39:22.220
until the third watch?

39:23.070 --> 39:23.670
What if

39:24.400 --> 39:26.400
he comes back early tonight?

39:27.000 --> 39:27.760
What if...

39:28.190 --> 39:29.120
There is no need.

39:29.510 --> 39:35.580
[Zhongwu Hall]

39:30.030 --> 39:31.290
Even if the light is on,

39:32.750 --> 39:33.840
it only illuminates

39:33.840 --> 39:35.440
an empty room.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.480
The money for the book is a small matter.

39:46.480 --> 39:48.880
I passed by your place
and saw the door ajar.

39:50.230 --> 39:51.830
May I sit with you for a while?

39:53.230 --> 39:54.590
In your life,

39:55.400 --> 39:57.880
you won't just meet Mr. Zhou.

39:56.640 --> 40:03.820
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

39:59.000 --> 40:01.710
You will meet so many people.

40:03.070 --> 40:05.110
You will live a good life.

40:03.850 --> 40:10.470
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

40:08.540 --> 40:11.090
[Zhongwu Hall]

40:10.570 --> 40:18.210
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

40:17.640 --> 40:20.070
[Zhongwu Hall]

40:18.330 --> 40:25.630
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

40:22.830 --> 40:24.210
Darling.

40:25.770 --> 40:32.700
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

40:29.240 --> 40:30.030
Darling!

40:32.800 --> 40:42.980
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

40:33.590 --> 40:34.850
The arrow's fletching

40:35.070 --> 40:37.400
tore through the cloth you wrapped for me.

40:37.550 --> 40:38.550
Please, darling,

40:40.280 --> 40:41.940
repair it for me one more time.

40:43.160 --> 40:50.340
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

40:50.360 --> 40:57.530
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

40:57.560 --> 41:01.140
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

41:01.160 --> 41:04.780
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

41:04.810 --> 41:11.220
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

41:06.630 --> 41:07.670
My wife

41:08.110 --> 41:09.110
is so impressive.

41:10.150 --> 41:11.320
It seems your medical skills

41:11.320 --> 41:13.320
are catching up with your mother's.

41:26.510 --> 41:32.980
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

41:33.090 --> 41:40.250
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

41:40.430 --> 41:47.790
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

41:40.560 --> 41:42.100
[Where grass turns green,
red plum buds]

41:47.900 --> 41:55.070
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

41:55.180 --> 42:02.480
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

42:02.600 --> 42:12.950
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

42:13.380 --> 42:19.980
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

42:20.100 --> 42:27.170
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

42:27.230 --> 42:30.580
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

42:30.610 --> 42:34.190
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

42:34.260 --> 42:40.600
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

42:41.130 --> 42:44.740
[Spring comes to Changmen, where grass turns green
Red plum buds just starting to bloom.]

42:44.770 --> 42:48.860
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust. A sip at
dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

42:45.270 --> 42:52.050
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

42:52.130 --> 42:59.200
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

42:59.260 --> 43:02.610
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

43:02.640 --> 43:06.220
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

